# ---- vendored third-party assets --------------------------------------------
# NOT ignored, deliberately. Every byte the course needs is committed, so a bare
# `git clone` is a complete, runnable, air-gapped course with no fetch step and no
# version drift. Provenance, licenses and SHA-384s: public/vendor/NOTICE.md.
# Verify with `bash tools/fetch-vendor.sh --check`.

# stray test scratch stores (tests now use the OS temp dir; this catches old ones)
